1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:12,005
Welcome to Inside the Work. This stadium brings six parts of ANC's design work into one place. Take the guided tour, or choose an exhibit and explore at your own pace.

2
00:00:12,705 --> 00:00:24,512
Start with Presentations. Open the real client example, move through its pages, and compare the shared experience with the downloadable PDF. This is the first stop for the team's review.

3
00:00:25,212 --> 00:00:37,150
Creative proof puts accepted work beside a new concept. Play both examples and compare the message, readability, and motion. The labels tell you which work was accepted and which is still a concept.

4
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:48,430
Every screen shows the actual production formats. Switch from the main board to the wide ribbon. The proportions change to match the original file, so you can see how the design adapts.

5
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:59,736
Venue experiences begins with a source photograph. Switch to the sponsor and concert concepts to see different directions for the same place. These images are visual studies for discussion.

6
00:01:00,436 --> 00:01:10,832
Design workflow follows a real request from the brief, through design and review, to the delivered files. Open each step to understand the handoff and the decision behind the accepted work.

7
00:01:11,532 --> 00:01:21,172
At Next together, keep the presentation platform as the first priority. Save an observation against an exhibit, then download your notes. They stay in this browser until you choose to share them.

8
00:01:21,872 --> 00:01:32,791
Use Share to copy a link to the current exhibit. Natalia and Daniel can return to it independently, or follow the guided tour together. The same experience stays available after the meeting.

